#: ../../legacy/cmucam2/legal.rst:13
msgid ""
"The CMUcam2 was designed very carefully. We have made every effort to avoid "
"mistakes but we cannot guarantee that the CMUCam2 is free of errors. The "
"information found on this website is given as an indication."
msgstr ""
"CMUcam2 je vrlo pažljivo dizajniran. Uložili smo sav napor da izbjegnemo "
"pogreške, ali ne možemo jamčiti da je CMUCam2 bez grešaka. Informacije na "
"ovoj web stranici dane su kao smjernica."

#: ../../legacy/cmucam2/legal.rst:18
